WEBVTT

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:26.130
It's a desert in the west.

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:26.930
It's a desert in the west.

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:28.170
It's a desert in the west.

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:29.430
It's a desert in the west.

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:30.000
It's a desert in the west.

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:32.310
Three days ago, they showed up.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:33.400
Thank you.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:36.780
Shirou! It's Batchi!

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:39.800
Let's contact the main force as well as the nearby battalions.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:44.200
Hey, are you listening?

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:46.520
Mikael!

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.460
Yes, what is it?

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.890
Let's contact the main force.

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:53.640
Yes, go ahead.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:57.640
Our 8th Brigade will locate the point that is predicted to be Shabakujo of the Zeon Army.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:00.000
Therefore, we will start the confirmation investigation.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:01.510
Roger that!

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:38.510
We don't have any radiation.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:39.540
Roger that.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:00.740
Yeah!

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:39.350
It turned into glass due to the heat of the beam.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:48.630
You're crazy!

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:51.820
The filter is sand and gravel!

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:54.880
Give me the M18 filter!

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.840
Wait a minute!

00:04:56.840 --> 00:05:00.000
This angle is from low-air.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:03.150
I'm sure it's the Shabakujou.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.380
Hey, this is the place, isn't it?

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:06.720
It's a pity.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:12.230
Kikino was right.

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:13.310
I'm grateful.

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:15.570
Yeah, be grateful.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.340
You can stay here.

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:19.860
We'll take care of the rest.

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:21.310
Be careful on your way home.

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:22.610
Is that what you mean?

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:23.720
Miss.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.740
I said I was going home.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.850
Mikkel, go to the cockpit.

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:28.420
Yes.

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:34.840
A beam weapon...

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:38.290
Even so, it's a huge amount of energy.

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:43.210
If that's the case, he's the only one left!

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:48.550
Try moving your ankle a little bit!

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:49.770
Just a little bit!

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:51.950
Yes!

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:57.440
I can do it!

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.440
Shia!

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:03.490
Ah! Ah! Ah! Hurry!

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.060
It's alive!

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:32.150
Good!

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:34.000
Don't fool around!

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:41.390
This is bad...

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:54.410
I can do it!

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.530
Erase the footprints!

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.930
I'm doing it right now!

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:04.720
I'll take care of the rest of this place.

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:06.170
Roger that.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:09.800
Mikkel, check the point of the balloon, too.

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:13.370
Mikkel, I'm going to switch to the wire.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.730
Cut off the wires.

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:16.660
Roger that.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:20.200
Mikkel, I'm the only one here.

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:27.830
I'm not going to do it all at once.

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:30.000
I'm sorry, Mikkel.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.010
It's me!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:33.480
Don't blame me for not being there!

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.640
You're not going out, are you?

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:36.660
Not yet.

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:41.700
The preparations for the parade are not over yet.

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:42.800
Mikel!

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.820
Yes, yes, yes, yes!

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:48.400
You guys can go home.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.720
But...

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:50.660
What?

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:53.590
You're not going to leave the young lady alone, are you?

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:57.680
The Federation is working on this information.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.000
We have to keep an eye on her until the end.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.200
What's with that captain? He's not even going to tell me what to do.

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:30.000
The enemy that invaded the city...

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:34.540
We're heading to Point Delta, which is thought to be a desert.

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:37.740
Minoski particle sample, are you ready Miguel?

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.800
Yes!

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:46.900
Point Alpha, pass!

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:48.460
The balloon has risen.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.990
I'll block the path.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:53.180
Simulation confirmed.

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:55.080
Sandus, are you ready to shoot?

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:58.130
I'm ready.

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:59.860
Simulation confirmed.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.710
Point Bravo!

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.000
Let the net go!

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.200
I'll make a bag construction!

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:09.280
I'll do it!

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:11.010
Confirmed!

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:12.700
Point Charlie passed!

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.880
Alright!

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.010
From the front point delta!

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:18.110
Concentration attack!

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:21.690
I'll win!

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.900
I'll finish you off!

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:37.970
What's wrong?

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.150
You're so stupid!

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:41.170
Ah, um...

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:44.100
Don't lose your mind without me!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:47.560
That's not what I meant!

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.300
I'm so sorry!

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:50.610
*sobbing*

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:06.260
I brought you some water and food.

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:08.530
Are you still here?

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:10.140
What do you mean, "still here"?

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:12.950
I'm here to give you something!

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:18.970
If you start fighting here,

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:28.950
I won't be able to guarantee your safety.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:29.860
Are you listening?

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.760
I'll fix it once it's broken.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.600
No problem.

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:41.490
I don't care. I'll fix it for you.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.990
No, you can't.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.230
You're embarrassing me!

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.410
Hey, stop it!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.530
Why can't I stop?

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:51.540
Hey, hurry up and do it!

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:54.160
That's it!

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:58.040
What are you doing?

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:02.710
Karen-neesan, can you hear me?

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:06.650
Hm? What's wrong?

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:13.520
No, I think it's fine.

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:17.150
What are you doing?

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:19.110
Water is precious.

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:20.610
For when the time comes.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.630
Hm?

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.230
*sobbing*

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:35.700
*sigh*

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:43.760
It hasn't been 30 minutes yet...

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.960
Did something happen?

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:52.660
Are you cheating on me?

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:54.710
It'll get cold at night!

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:55.890
I can do it!

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:57.720
How's the other team?

00:11:57.720 --> 00:12:00.000
Ah! Ah! There's nothing in there!

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.000
Don't let her use the transmitter!

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:09.820
Ah, what is it with the captain?

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:16.400
He's so stubborn.

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:20.050
Hey Kiki, are you in love with the captain?

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:24.320
Is this a letter from your lover?

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:26.240
Stop it! Give it back!

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:30.000
Miken!

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:43.340
It's always just a comfort for me, Matsumi!

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:48.200
But, but, it's always scary!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:51.090
I think this is the last letter.

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:56.720
I feel like war is going to take you far away...

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:07.560
And I can't stand the terror of the letter getting stuck.

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:15.360
If this is the case, I wonder how much easier it would be to forget about you.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:19.440
I can't read anymore. I'm sorry.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:25.320
It's okay. I'll definitely come back alive.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.450
It feels good. I'm not far away.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:37.490
I wonder if she'll understand if I write a letter to her.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:40.040
I know how she feels, but...

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.720
Really?

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:47.370
I have no choice but to knock your feelings down.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:50.790
That's the only thing I know.

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:52.910
I see.

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:54.360
I see.

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:58.450
But it's too late to knock them down.

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:03.520
Even if it's close, sometimes it's not.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:35.350
Ah, bean-cooking sure is a pain in the neck.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.950
Hey, I'll do it myself.

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:40.560
The food was pretty good, wasn't it?

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.230
It was good, but...

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.820
But, you know, how long are you going to...

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:48.110
Captain, how long are you going to...

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:50.920
I don't know.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:52.980
It's already the fifth day today.

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:56.770
This plan was supposed to last for three days, wasn't it?

00:14:56.770 --> 00:15:00.000
Ah, stop taking a shower.

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:03.110
I want to drink some cold beer.

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:06.540
This heat is making me crazy.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:16.070
I... I can't take it anymore!

00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:20.390
I can't stand standing still in a place like this!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:23.540
Even if I write a letter, I'm not going to get out of it!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:27.830
Even though BB is waiting for me, damn it, damn it!

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:28.950
You can do it.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.000
Thank you very much.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:33.340
But you have a lot of problems, don't you?

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:34.550
What do you mean?

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:39.420
Hey, if it's a letter, I'll deliver it to you!

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:43.800
A letter?

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:46.330
I'll go and give it to you.

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:49.500
You just have to deliver it to the main force, right?

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:52.340
My friends have a lot of free time.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:54.110
Kiki!

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:56.140
Hey, wait a minute!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.220
What?

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.540
Stop feeling like you're going on a picnic!

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:03.200
We're not moving because of our mood. We're moving because of our orders!

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:06.570
We're moving because of our own convenience.

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:09.160
We don't have the right to be ordered by you!

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:14.430
I appreciate your cooperation, but please don't act like you've gone too far!

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:18.030
I'm not acting like I've gone too far!

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:22.020
I've been ordered not to give out letters!

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:26.130
How long are you going to hold on to me?!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:30.000
What's with this guy?

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.430
What are you whispering about?

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:37.720
You're the one who's whispering, not me!

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:43.060
Captain!

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:46.420
Why can't you be more kind to me?

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:52.170
You don't understand how I feel at all, do you?

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:58.610
Are you crazy?

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:00.000
That kind of watch...

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:02.000
You hold it so preciously!

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:08.040
Mikuru!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.870
You're the kind of person who only thinks of yourself!

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:14.180
I don't want to be told by you!

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:18.280
You're the one who's worried about me.

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:22.200
You're more serious than the one who doesn't even try to understand!

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:23.180
Mikuru!

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:27.300
It's more difficult to convey my feelings when I understand it!

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:29.830
You're...

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:32.750
That's the worst thing I could do!

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:39.210
That's enough.

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:49.920
I'm going back.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.620
Mikkel, you take the Mobile Suit.

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:54.470
I'll take it.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:55.550
That's impossible!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:57.920
If you leave this guy to you now,

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:00.000
the entire Hachio team will be destroyed!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:24.280
Even I don't understand how I feel.

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:28.870
It's cold. You'll wake up.

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:32.460
It's a special water, isn't it?

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.940
Refill your water.

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:35.910
Thank you.

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:37.520
You know...

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:43.170
I'm not good at talking.

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:48.590
Why does it turn out like this?

00:18:48.590 --> 00:18:52.030
Inazahari...

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:55.850
Was there a person?

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:58.250
It's not strange to look like him.

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.000
I can't believe it.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.230
I guess you're right about that.

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:07.210
Captain, the song that's playing right now is from Eredoran.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:11.000
Eredoran?

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:25.630
It's a good song.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:27.310
Yeah.

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:30.000
I'm not sure about that.

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:34.500
Our next song is a request from a nightclub hospital.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:37.860
It's from Eleanor Mathis, who has been defamed.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:39.610
Okay, let's move on to the next song.

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:40.800
What?

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:43.410
Did she request it herself?

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:44.760
Well...

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:51.220
Eleanor Mathis!

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:54.810
She's honest with herself.

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:55.920
That person is...

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:13.220
You're a good boy!

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:22.920
Give it to me!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.400
It's not a big deal.

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:32.400
Yes!

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:33.320
I'm coming!

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.720
I won't die!

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:36.740
Nibiru!

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:38.920
You have to believe me and wait for me!

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:39.840
My feelings...

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:42.790
I have no choice but to hit you!

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.790
Point Alpha Zuka!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:45.620
He's the only one!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.990
Gekiru Age!

00:25:03.930 --> 00:25:07.450
I can't believe that Aina is the pilot of Zeon's new weapon!

00:25:07.450 --> 00:25:11.020
I was about to kill Aina.

00:25:11.020 --> 00:25:16.130
A huge mountain range is approaching before us, who were able to confirm our safety.

00:25:16.130 --> 00:25:23.270
If we find a way to save them, we'll be able to live or die together!

00:25:23.270 --> 00:25:28.850
Next time, Mobile Suit Gundam No. 08-MS. Reunited!

00:26:27.100 --> 00:26:30.000
They were working on a project developed by Zeon Advertising.

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:31.510
a scoop video of a working machine.

00:26:31.510 --> 00:26:33.840
The Minovsky particle was discovered,

00:26:33.840 --> 00:26:37.900
and the Zeon Empire was engaged in the development of mobile weapons and mobile suits,

00:26:37.900 --> 00:26:41.470
but the official announcement was that it was the development of a working machine.

00:26:41.470 --> 00:26:43.800
The Federation was wary,

00:26:43.800 --> 00:26:47.890
but they received a video of the test landscape carried out by the Zeonics,

00:26:47.890 --> 00:26:50.620
and they were relieved to see it.

00:26:50.620 --> 00:26:55.120
No video revealed the possibility of it being a weapon.

00:26:55.120 --> 00:26:57.440
This video was popular,

00:26:57.440 --> 00:27:00.000
and some of the Miihas said it was cute.

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:02.960
such as peeling boiled eggs,

00:27:02.960 --> 00:27:04.740
tying a wire muffler,

00:27:04.740 --> 00:27:07.400
or making a castle with a loader,

00:27:07.400 --> 00:27:09.900
and creating a pretty demo.

00:27:09.900 --> 00:27:13.230
However, in Gionic,

00:27:13.230 --> 00:27:17.350
MS-05 Zaku was actually training the loader.

00:27:17.350 --> 00:27:19.140
What can I hide?

00:27:19.140 --> 00:27:22.490
The scoop video was intentionally shown by Gionic,

00:27:22.490 --> 00:27:24.990
and it was a test of the Federation's reaction.

00:27:24.990 --> 00:27:27.860
The Federation was caught red-handed,

00:27:27.860 --> 00:27:30.000
but they were able to get a lot of scoop videos.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:33.780
and this is how the Zeonics challenged the shadow of the Sle-Sle.

00:27:33.780 --> 00:27:38.260
This video is a bit strange for a test for a working machine.

00:27:38.260 --> 00:27:42.130
The Federation was laughing at the anxiety of the Zeonics.

00:27:42.130 --> 00:27:47.120
However, what should be laughed at was the inferiority of the Federation.

00:27:47.120 --> 00:27:52.870
The meaning of the Minovsky particle is the collapse of the radar line and the revival of the white line.

00:27:52.870 --> 00:27:56.400
If the Federation had noticed the possibility a little more,

00:27:56.400 --> 00:27:59.890
the development of the Zeon mobile suit would have changed.

00:28:00.280 --> 00:28:10.080
The Zeon Empire, which was convinced of the Federation's caution, enters the Mobile Suit mass production system in the Side 3, a closed-type colony that is also known as the Black Box.
